# ── Live object detection (crop to the animal before classifying) ─────────────
# Same MegaDetector generation (v5a) already used to produce this project's
# training-time boxes (data/md_boxes.parquet, via src/eda/eda02_box.py).
# Pinned to 5.0.3 deliberately: megadetector>=5.0.26 switches its YOLOv5
# backend to the legacy `ultralytics-yolov5==0.1.1` shim, which hard-pins
# protobuf<=3.20.1 -- unsatisfiable together with tensorboard>=6.31.1 (already
# required here). 5.0.3 depends on the actively-maintained `yolov5` package
# instead, which has no such pin, so it resolves cleanly alongside the rest
# of this project's stack. Tradeoff: 5.0.3 installs its submodules
# (detection, api, classification, data_management, md_utils,
# md_visualization, taxonomy_mapping) as bare top-level packages rather than
# namespaced under `megadetector.` -- verified these don't collide with
# anything else in this project or its dependencies.
megadetector==5.0.3

